sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant NET as ConnectivityService
    participant SYNC as SyncService
    participant OFS as OfflineExpenseService
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    NET-->>SYNC: internet_restored
    SYNC->>OFS: getPendingOperations()
    OFS-->>SYNC: pending operations list

    loop For each pending operation
      SYNC->>API: Execute queued request
      API->>DB: Apply operation
      DB-->>API: Result
      API-->>SYNC: Success/Failure
      SYNC->>OFS: markSynced() or keepForRetry()
    end

    SYNC->>API: Fetch latest roomspace data
    API->>DB: Query fresh data
    DB-->>API: Latest data
    API-->>SYNC: Data payload
    SYNC->>OFS: updateLocalCache(data)
